sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Studio as Microduck Studio
    participant Animate as Animate tab
    participant DuckLab as Duck Lab
    participant API as Studio RLX API
    participant CLI as ppo_microduck_studio.py
    participant Env as Dance imitation env
    participant PPO as RLX PPO / MLX
    participant Store as Run artifacts

    User->>Studio: Select Dance imitation
    Studio-->>User: Show required input: motion clip
    Note over Studio,User: Dance needs a clip. It does not need a user velocity command.

    alt Packaged RLX workflow
        User->>Studio: Select Pipeline smoke or Full training
        Studio->>API: POST /api/rlx action=train, recipe=dance
        API->>CLI: Launch macOS RLX process
        CLI->>Env: Load imitate + dance-120bpm
    else Custom authored clip workflow
        User->>Animate: Create 2-4 s loop, 14 joints per key
        Animate->>DuckLab: PUT /clips/{name}
        DuckLab-->>Animate: Saved clip metadata
        User->>Animate: Select train this
        Animate->>DuckLab: POST /teach text=copy animation, clip=name
        DuckLab->>Env: Load imitate + selected clip
    end

    Note over Env: Inputs each 50 Hz step:<br/>robot state + previous action + clip phase<br/>velocity command is zero / unused for dance
    loop PPO practice
        Env->>PPO: observations[batch,61], rewards, done flags
        PPO->>Env: actions[batch,14]
        PPO-->>Studio: rollout progress + mean reward
        Studio-->>User: Update progress and Reward history
    end

    PPO->>Store: Save checkpoint + normalization metadata
    CLI->>Store: Export deterministic ONNX
    User->>Studio: Run evaluation
    Studio->>API: POST /api/rlx action=eval
    API->>CLI: Evaluate checkpoint or ONNX
    CLI->>Env: Deterministic rollout
    Env->>Store: evaluation.json
    Store-->>Studio: finite actions, return, pose RMSE

    User->>Studio: Render rollout
    Studio->>API: POST /api/rlx action=render
    API->>CLI: Render 120-second show
    CLI->>Env: Loop learned short motif
    Env->>Store: MP4 + contact sheet
    Store-->>User: Review motion and accept, revise, or reject
